---
title: "How GoServe gets better by itself — every run teaches the next run. A person says yes before any change goes live."
---
flowchart LR
  %% D6. Top strip: the learning loop for every workflow. Bottom strip: how our own model (Laya) replaces Jev.
  subgraph loop[" "]
    loopHead["<b>A · LEARNING LOOP — every workflow</b>"]
    cap["<b>1 · Capture</b><br/>log each run: settings version,<br/>input, answer, time, cost"]
    mea["<b>2 · Measure</b><br/>daily scorecard, paired numbers<br/>(on time % + promised time)"]
    pro["<b>3 · Propose</b><br/>owner idea, or a big AI model<br/>reads the numbers weekly"]
    tst["<b>4 · Test</b><br/>replay past orders with<br/>the new settings first"]
    pmt["<b>5 · Promote</b><br/>owner says yes · small trial ·<br/>one-step undo"]
  end
  subgraph fly[" "]
    flyHead["<b>B · LAYA REPLACES JEV — our own decision model</b>"]
    lg["<b>Log every decision</b><br/>(rows from step 1) options, rule pick, Jev pick,<br/>chosen pick + its chance"]
    lb["<b>Add the answer later</b><br/>late or on time, ops change,<br/>owner thumbs up or down"]
    tr["<b>Train Laya</b><br/>free notebook (Kaggle / Colab),<br/>real data for the final test"]
    sh["<b>Quiet test</b><br/>Laya answers next to Jev<br/>for 2 weeks, not used yet"]
    lv["<b>Go live</b><br/>Laya → Jev → rule backup ·<br/>Jev cost goes to $0"]
  end
  loopHead ~~~ cap
  flyHead ~~~ lg
  cap -->|"runs pile up"| mea
  mea -->|"a number slips"| pro
  pro -->|"new settings"| tst
  tst -->|"passes the bar"| pmt
  lg -->|"after delivery"| lb
  lb -->|"enough rows"| tr
  tr -->|"new model"| sh
  sh -->|"beats Jev and the rule"| lv

  classDef head fill:#F7F3EF,stroke:#F7F3EF,color:#263528
  classDef lane fill:#F7F3EF,stroke:#7F9743,stroke-width:3px,color:#263528
  classDef step fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#45654E,stroke-width:2px,color:#263528
  classDef gate fill:#FFDE59,stroke:#263528,stroke-width:2px,color:#263528
  classDef win fill:#45654E,stroke:#263528,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFFFFF
  class loopHead,flyHead head
  class loop,fly lane
  class cap,mea,pro,lg,lb,tr,sh step
  class tst gate
  class pmt,lv win
